    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Mental Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>You can lock eyes with an opponent to zap the energy out of them or even turn them to stone! You gain the Petrifying Gaze Creature Trait.  While there’s nothing physically wrong with your eyes, others find them deeply unsettling in an unnatural way. Perhaps it’s true what people say, that the eyes are windows to the soul. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
